    "title": "Express conditions and likely outcomes",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-conditions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express conditions and likely outcomes",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "如果 or 要是 introduces a possible condition; the condition can also end with 的话. Its subject may stand before or after 如果. In the response, put 就 after the subject and before the predicate. These frames do not assert that the condition has already happened.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "如果你来，我就去。",
                "pinyin": "rúguǒ nǐ lái ， wǒ jiù qù 。",
                "meaning": "If you come, I will go.",
                "audio": "a19f0503aa2c8021987645adfb246c5482288cfdebdaf1d048612268408368d4"
              },
              {
                "text": "你如果来，我就去。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ rúguǒ lái ， wǒ jiù qù 。",
                "meaning": "If you come, I will go.",
                "audio": "9c45805b7342c630de664f88bdfd5903fef44b191bf7c7bdb97696e4c2bfce37"
              },
              {
                "text": "要是下雨，我们就在里面看书。",
                "pinyin": "yàoshi xiàyǔ ， wǒmen jiù zài lǐmiàn kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "If it rains, we will read inside.",
                "audio": "8cd5b19fabe3efa82dcbf6e00d786ee905c67c756db07bcf5c14b2ac191033fe"
              },
              {
                "text": "下雨的话，我们就在里面看书。",
                "pinyin": "xiàyǔ dehuà ， wǒmen jiù zài lǐmiàn kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "If it rains, we will read inside.",
                "audio": "45a2e98711e50f6fa15f60181292180407b88b8c873a74c73a8a2729c3d459c6"
              }
            ]
          },
